{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_043nor0263_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_043nor0263_1000_p", "source_sha256": "973254e5cd69735dd66a727e81f0086dfabf6a41d0ff3707965bca2cd6513f9f", "ja": "（今日はグラビア雑誌『アイグラ！！』の撮影。\nテーマは『普段寝る前にしていること』らしいが……）", "zh": "（今天是写真杂志《爱格拉！！》的拍摄。\n听说主题是“平时睡前会做的事”，不过……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_043nor0263_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_043nor0263_1001_043nor", "source_sha256": "f0ff14dc23d9c70fa7f86c3fcce0a3e8d7daadcd2907d3446a2ecaa5da5bfa8a", "ja": "{$P$}。\nほ、本当にこのパジャマ姿で撮影するの？", "zh": "{$P$}。\n真、真的要穿着这身睡衣拍摄吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_043nor0263_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_043nor0263_1002_p", "source_sha256": "c8c2c5da2ed6ae3bb11d9c75303d7cb1ca1fa4beb27357d555764096bd457707", "ja": "ああ。もちろん。……うん、似合ってるじゃないか。\nいい写真がいっぱい撮れそうだよ。", "zh": "嗯，当然。……你穿起来很合适嘛。\n感觉能拍出很多不错的照片。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_043nor0263_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_043nor0263_1003_043nor", "source_sha256": "03a0d9784e086e4b017f2978be6eb45a418219441ef65cc8f7c0de4e72b6532c", "ja": "あ、ありがとう……。けど、テーマが\n『普段寝る前にしてること』でしょ？", "zh": "啊，谢谢……不过，主题是“平时睡前会做的事”吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_043nor0263_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_043nor0263_1004_043nor", "source_sha256": "e326ffd899596c27d92ef4235d827b00388593ded907e21ca5a750ecd1031fc5", "ja": "こんな可愛いパジャマ姿で\n普段のアタシを見せることなんてできないよ……。", "zh": "穿着这么可爱的睡衣，怎么能让大家看到平时的我啊……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_043nor0263_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_043nor0263_1005_p", "source_sha256": "5e16da7b0a658cf10d3e5b3d38bc5c32e668e97c3bf384101525011c0f6a49ba", "ja": "え？　それは……ええと、どういう事だ？", "zh": "诶？这……那个，到底是怎么回事？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_043nor0263_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_043nor0263_1006_043nor", "source_sha256": "0497a10caaf7c85cdd402c536d70d8e63b6e98773ddf2aa23d1d420d5aa2b618", "ja": "う、うん……あのね、アタシ……。\nたまに寝る前に、枕にプロレス技かけたりするの！", "zh": "嗯、嗯……那个啊，我……\n偶尔会在睡前对枕头使出摔角招式！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_043nor0263_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_043nor0263_1007_043nor", "source_sha256": "f4c3927f8b766820a7f733bbd64659b530ad95cc5c1b900902faab4bc4835aaf", "ja": "枕じゃ物足りないときは、更に布団を丸めたりして。\nもうバッタンバッタン！1、2、3！って感じで。", "zh": "枕头不够过瘾的时候，我还会把被子卷起来。  \n然后就是砰砰砰！1、2、3！这种感觉。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_043nor0263_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_043nor0263_1008_043nor", "source_sha256": "34e466c27f0f4c216ae5c67612a4805227d7ed01f29c965e84ff799fe9198653", "ja": "だからね、今日は普段どおりじゃなくて……パジャマの\nイメージ通り、落ち着いた写真がいいかなって。", "zh": "所以啊，今天不想像平时那样……我觉得还是按照睡衣的形象，拍些沉稳的照片比较好。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_043nor0263_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_043nor0263_1009_p", "source_sha256": "fd269761bb556ed7139c13b7ec65d8181380b4daa9a1caf2b87cef39f89826e4", "ja": "なるほど……それも悪くないとは思うけど……。\nまずはテーマ通りに撮影してみないか？", "zh": "原来如此……我觉得那样也不错，不过……\n要不先按照主题拍摄看看？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_043nor0263_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_043nor0263_1010_043nor", "source_sha256": "529bdf3a17e6cdbe2eab534be3427c827824af64147967f31598712712061ba4", "ja": "せっかくシルクのパジャマなのに？\nアタシのプロレス技、激しいよ？", "zh": "难得穿上丝绸睡衣，真的要这样吗？\n我的摔跤招式可是很激烈的哦？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_043nor0263_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_043nor0263_1011_p", "source_sha256": "0b6d1727d287e23c69d1a819fc45b4acf896c5cd4232c30ceae230206c512728", "ja": "ああ、どんどんかけてくれ。可愛いパジャマと、\nかっこいいのり子。そういうのも面白いじゃないか。", "zh": "啊，尽管放马过来吧。可爱的睡衣和帅气的典子，这样的组合不是也很有意思吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_043nor0263_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_043nor0263_1012_043nor", "source_sha256": "96f1ff768dfce0a5c494468d7f6b99f97d25eaa4ed3c2db230d34834de6ed814", "ja": "本当？　じゃあ、\n入場パフォーマンスとかもしてもいい？", "zh": "真的吗？那我也可以表演入场秀之类的吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_043nor0263_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_043nor0263_1013_p", "source_sha256": "056b3680aff62b98f690eb2c02a52120278b701d746cf8ad660346e47d0e9454", "ja": "ああ、もちろん！\nのり子らしいところが撮れそうだしな。", "zh": "啊，当然可以！\n这样应该能拍到符合典子的风格的画面。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_043nor0263_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_043nor0263_1014_043nor", "source_sha256": "7340ffda5c35414dbd05d0adc26607ba2cdbbf73c6822f0acc3c8496777421ed", "ja": "そっか……うん、{$P$}、\nアタシ普段通りの感じで、撮影に挑戦してみるよ！", "zh": "这样啊……嗯，{$P$}，我会以平时的状态挑战拍摄！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_043nor0263_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_043nor0263_1015_043nor", "source_sha256": "787e291b227911857a3806ad8f2bd13d50010984261d80bf30fc4e3dbeb07913", "ja": "じゃあせっかくだし、撮影前に練習したいんだけど……\nいい？　実はまだ、新技がうまく決まらないんだよね。", "zh": "既然难得有这个机会，我想在拍摄前练习一下……\n可以吗？其实我还没能顺利使出新招呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_043nor0263_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_043nor0263_1016_p", "source_sha256": "a9317997c88513f5f4ac3f8a9b50ab6a2f8e5bc0d5e4fb10e9e91d14b802ea36", "ja": "ああ、撮影が始まるまで、思いっきり練習しておこう。", "zh": "啊，那就趁拍摄开始前，尽情练习吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_043nor0263_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_043nor0263_1017_043nor", "source_sha256": "e7093e81a4979e540b548254ad91b8a9f854f0eb7f03dc294c6450a2a8c807a0", "ja": "ありがと♪　じゃあ、{$P$}、\n力を抜いて、ジッとしててね！", "zh": "谢谢♪那么，{$P$}，放松身体，乖乖别动哦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_043nor0263_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_043nor0263_1018_p", "source_sha256": "e51fed40d22600e3b93b34addbf25b12f55f013fbfa8ce88919511ec70bb0134", "ja": "え、枕で試すんじゃないのか？　ちょ、\nちょっと待て！　ストップだ、のり子……！", "zh": "咦，不是要拿枕头试的吗？等、等一下！停下，乃莉子……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
